zig, im April 1790.</hi></dateline>
<lb/>
<signed><hi rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#fr">Johann Dorotheus
Kleyb,<space dim="horizontal"/></hi><lb/>
Buchha&#x0364;ndler,<space dim="horizontal"/></hi></signed></closer>
</div>
<lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>
<lb/>
<div type="jAn">
