&#x017F;em
Monat er&#x017F;cheinen.</hi></p><closer><dateline><hi rendition="#fr"> Leipzig, am 1&#x017F;ten April 1790.</hi></dateline>
<lb/>
<signed><hi rendition="#fr"><hi rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#aq">Dr.</hi> <hi rendition="#fr">Chri&#x017F;tian Daniel
